/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// An actor that waits for its own answer, or for itself to end, would wait forever; it gets C0119 instead.
act selfish(state, me)
    return :await(:request(me, 1))
xx
s | :actor(0, selfish)
:post(s, s)
attempt
    :await(s)
rescue e
    say(:has("{e}", "C0119: actor-self-wait"))
xx
